# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This Git repo should contain ONLY the website (the "Website" folder).
# Everything else in the Meridian Implant Advisory project folder
# (booklet PDFs, Legal, Logo, Client Development, status logs, etc.)
# is private business material and must NOT be pushed to GitHub.
#
# Rule below: ignore everything at the project root, then explicitly
# allow back just the Website folder and this .gitignore file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ignore everything at the root of the project...
/*

# ...but keep the website and this file.
!/Website/
!/.gitignore

# Never track macOS Finder junk, even inside Website/
.DS_Store
